  "scope": "Two disposable kind clusters, Linux kube-proxy iptables, two workers, TCP echo pods, local Octavia WSGI and SQLite, installed Amphora renderer and native HAProxy. A tunnel and source NAT connect HAProxy to the kind NodePorts. Local fixtures supply Keystone, Neutron, provisioning completion and Amphora transport."
